  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:587d7167cb6257848393c11a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……赛马娘的足迹……\r\n我可以看一辈子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "725e751bf2d976e52860a05b499bb15358d6b5957f8d59132caac1bd73d9137f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be3af61df3cb3062543ee41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下辈子要是当个种胡萝卜的农人\r\n也不错耶……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1952e0b861d66dadb46e11d0d91ccc544f7705c24f2a90b6713f84051286144",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56d13cc8341d5b441ad6c115",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很感激能跟我的推一起跑……\r\n但难道不会因为勉强别人\r\n给周遭添很多麻烦吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bf87af3b45a306f5d535193231fb4e3a8efe0aed6a666b2a39c93ccebfef379",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29cfc8806d96d4cd771cc5e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的没问题吗……\r\n以这种状态出赛，\r\n应该会造成旁人困扰吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eaabda26a3fb8c9ee7397e4308db2633f590891688e25a41060f79a69de476b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8c965afd03393caa7e9949e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我等这一天等很久了！！\r\n来吧来吧，我会尽全力\r\n感受着赛马娘喔～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0708f4b6bd419cf6af0c58a355c3e93060417bf84a3b5c61bed9bacb7a030aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5b32ab35421aef6f78c24e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～～呼…………！\r\n太兴奋也不行啊！\r\n反而会没办法顺利跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2c1701270ad46b77d18ac16991e18b3ea270aa49e75562dd76276e4c2cffae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:386e496802aff01acd60ec6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜者舞台要用的扇子和手灯\r\n我都准备好了！\r\n嗯，已经做好万全准备咯！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8328a532ce64bf82872870bc87aa34b6c9c10412b2e16911bdafef51ae2498a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b602778662cc96e07e578aa4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天赛马娘会露出\r\n什么样的表情……！？唔呵呵，\r\n已经等不及要比赛了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc98a2b39824c694a9c0857c0fede0fd0761d925b2c6f4712576c603b683cfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7086554656b4775f3e5543ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要跑，就要用尽全力！\r\n我一定会好好努力，\r\n不然对我推的大家就太失礼了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebad0c326bc48575b528722491898ed189ec1dedccb80cd82d6635bc5530b1d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfdf55e33dff8d12689e3158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相机准备好了吗？\r\n观众席的拍摄角度\r\n就交给你咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59c94d67d454a867262b2e64122cbd5ee236c6a7c125421cb825e5501a4c79cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff689ea3a5b2b2c0a83fdbe5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谨守着清白正直的分寸！\r\n数码碳要上场咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e333080c04250fdfdaf3bfc7a1cf7edfdd90afdde6b583c2ff72cf45f36df1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89aa46c59d80c431dd9c32e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然要冷静！\r\n拿出全力投入比赛才是有礼貌的行为！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fcb8e0af1a139449d0a0e39358a1c112b12df69ad2c73443c64e2be5dddfd12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ebf626226541e2213f947e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之后请告诉我\r\n从观众席观看的感想喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ff69ddacb6ec3302d6bb94b9a628c28337a207fba982f5af90254e59d5bf406",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f786702e3ee3a7ea29bfcb40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要站上赛道，\r\n应该就会开始涌出萌力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f65e7c72b8d6379f8ce7e945c5b96945ab6b32ac456c81bc26ab2f5035a8eb48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e1463a4eac63fd5d215dd4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的心情\r\n想在观众席看比赛……\r\n不，没什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b260e3383ec26970101a7eaf1a6653226c04cccbb6a3869ad9428f7adc64e28e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d270ae579952f3a2b7dc858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你不觉得比赛的参赛名单\r\n永远都看不腻吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e206e4552a0bdb2b9247843877b74c8b3297343aeee71c58ee1dead2eba7789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:565e8625bb3e1539b934a7b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇……！请给我\r\n能转换心情的萌图……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07237d9a69764e062b90d90d9552cd22586cdd6f44adf9e0b2bd8e5abcb2808b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c3adef6850f985b36461fc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行不行，\r\n我可不能玷污圣地……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64a577bfa5aba0fa064edd771d124368eb46389078d6b90e34ca075a06435393",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d063d278ca7d51c34c84c5e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要心中抱着对赛马娘的敬爱……\r\n这不算什么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b7dea63595c6dcb7c2079cc6c2a4dc87b825942f1beda11fcdca0e078212683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017549a518ea2ffb0c6e0e9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "092de8b679dc1d62be9d0345f00b41ce5d39669391cc434ea8f1c32929be88df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8cd8670026348ddc1dceb42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这么做吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed55896a91ce9fb27f01c61fc08829813f56c7c7f85176544912f96748735bb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:105fbfd020383accc3ec8368",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很乐意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac2052cd5d9873a7be5fc195f8a85bc42ae6614ef34dab5ec2b9a8271cb6c042",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74941db085ea6263fa3e3ec2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd39c284289b19c8944436e7ca3b6b2ead589d70912da6f1ecd3665819f7367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1432a930632ad610990ee77c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae3c180dcecb8a7613b6e412d08cc8e7cda5fed2bebc211ad0bba7fef4c82bbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b894d7fa278bd8deb7619250",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd70fd5cc899e529832077f4470a15938660894d1bb0d16f54d9460ae051fc29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:809713eae9f5fd5302654804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b58d964d17854a803d16140a894079104ae8c9281e306d5f49a7ec42fc0837d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc05381d9a72ea856d3152c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赞赞～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4132c9eb4965ebba46fd18630137c3795288eba93c8757d3a8a52e36268caad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:263304ba02a9e3b15d556b73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又加深了对我的推的认识！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1054ca9fa9cc4820bfc09f7591919bd1ace0a3244b7ccafe169d5168ed5a6995",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5323bd4afdbf68137accf025",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是太感谢了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec733b0dd84b4b80c6ac6a39572ea8a9bfc4fd862ae3bb203552364434e33094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e6552ae5dea513194e83b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我竟然可以免费跟主推一起训练！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "95bdbf9904a8e4e8b96572503cd8d17aeeba0c78df4ef50bf2596c2b9e8c14b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc224d69c7d92e038f455ed8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来帮你介绍！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e63c9689ff5cf3c51ebd8dfa3bc96d20714524aea0abca993bb27c24c65b42ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffde04d141a92b3b80a5f296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请多多指教……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df32da16abbc60d78eb1f8d5b391d663ff9d2459d2d8be6b44369ab0f0903b21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
