    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9343f6f40104dd72590d71a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赞赞！尊爆！我的女神！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac797239ca81bf47d7157a20951265d84a8c5d6dca7b5d5158811b1315cd6b37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd14cefd1fcca41ce6d70618",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟、跟赛马娘们同心协力\r\n在圣蹄祭摆摊……！？\r\n青春之光会让我蒸发了啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef97720ee0eff13cbe20c4587cf7ad59f05ab2af595a420a9cea41b668d95c64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cfb0af361fa54839ce789eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿宅是绝对不能对推逾矩的。不过，\r\n如果我们原本就有另一层关系……\r\n不行，我做不出那种事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ab346ee1dfa3fa9d11d34c594ae545aeb490268c0c48f20800fb83e2e1ee2f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d4107368ee8bd6561b6688d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那边！这边！还有那边！\r\n全部！喜欢！好喜欢！\r\n补充萌力，加到MAX！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b2feab4bfb7f5d50aa7467a615a6fe9f8dcf2afe4672a93256d4368b298065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b49e4f7c2a0f9f91b9302870",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望明天起我也能时时牢记……\r\n我的推同时也是劲敌，\r\n更是自己的伙伴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bdd64dd8ee5ad4a8733f4b7b21244893bb89da3cd5a1c27aabb133e031580c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02f1c27a8c2e6011e2253ddd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然已经创造了快乐回忆……\r\n来吧，本季度也要尽全力\r\n大推狂推猛推各位赛马娘喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3746f0e705306bc241d3340d17cb53aab1adaf4c882bb6c9dfd59f731ef364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47f2f067650d6aa587cc5221",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "萌到复活的阿宅殭尸（吸气）……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff98255ca3c1202f67d679354e4af74953356922b9cb5b0f596aff655e422e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc7ca11c722a6a9ec5a576c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我看到了……呜嘎──！啊啊\r\n啊……太～尊～了～～！发粮啦～！\r\n喝！发狂阿宅嘿呀嘿……（倒下）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b48800be867a91515ea48a63aa277ac9326c99829bd147336e0d41994434658d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06d655fa0a508fc199dcdd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了好了，演唱会的时间到了！\r\n各位同志，现在是展现热情的时候咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad527eb3d9c63e65770bd07018f92dc97de31ccb869c2940263fcdf01e9bf4ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c9629cd771cc52505860fef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手灯就拜托你了……！\r\n拜托连我的份一起用力挥……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e88fcff41d78ff7a684eb09e66b6f501bf08dabc0de0978ff4f70e58d58ea3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a56f5044e09e5977ae738ec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃得苦中苦，方为萌中萌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80cdd2b34765f5be31efef5f0ae543c02165a07c06c823a3038607dc34663e6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f503ea071eb1519920c1d15e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "第一次见面时，\r\n我当下就灵光乍现！\r\n觉得你是能和我携手同行的同志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21622406efb8f2fe9bb5e11cf8938a366b78d0515203a8a713081ca952087fe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdbb27f091c3815a8fc59488",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个，就是这个！\r\n非圣地巡礼的圣服穿着！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f2bbc9730016e42394acdf3b4584367dd78d39a2109cf1ae259d15a112f7ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0cfe45303bb5376a5c5ca3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "憧憬的服装……！虽然已经在原稿上\r\n画过很多次，居然要实际穿上……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e7403b3f0ffef218227cd6b7267753d83b54fa07c5f1c96c24658671985486",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d8730d906ece2f64825422",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我是在场上跑的人……\r\n就是这套服装让我持续陷入妄想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd72b5da1760a8acbe6dbf6a6985e83823ce042954c6bf1c4998061ded150ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46d959948b6690b4ea3e631b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我有成功变成墙壁吗？\r\n有完全融入吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7fa1e2be8f0230caf9c7b8bafa2cf7cd269b97b471de68b5fdf323af8cc475",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfa8944ff0cc880f9eefe4b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到处都能看见用心呢……！\r\n要让赛马娘上镜头的用心……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b485ee26d5daf2a869d41c535cb6461e746c82e9a8eca4ac95f555ad05214d7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a023acaf48db44b1cba15053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是的，完全都是我的喜好！\r\n……感觉有点难为情呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e2dd5953a93eb3722d3c0c1174e45bf6f40b32b888497dd4b5f3b6721ac600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2323abd6c90d14129309ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "殭尸在萌萌指引之下复活！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75fe4e8a5d5fc7bc20966b242748fe4273e3019a9cd827e4ae99395f8b5d377a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7825a7ea0d1b5bc55039e28d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装处处充满我的巧思，\r\n以免站在暗处时吓到别人……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ca8d8cf2f5f9b7bcac1389cd690b8ede2e443742f85a36984d43a7c86585c5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c338e9cb538e7c96a177d4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是数码碳喔──☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3056cac86b0710b40349bce1c0e988c05a42d9886adc0782e9c6edd680fb2775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37fa86d657a1049197f49195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算对手是赛马娘，我也不会输喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ade0adf1ca5ff846a5c8a2e394f4d79ad2b45d0464c911069405bddca02dbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b24ddc081a5e776ce606e0da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去圣地巡礼吗！？还是现场参战！？\r\n去哪我都跟着去喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c384a34fb05948410281105ff553913f2064dbe20f88fb9ba8eb6d9e466cf463",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e93bcf0cec5e1a27a3600848",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拟态完成……☆\r\n我只是一个随处可见的平凡赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae77695100f00dfcdb7246f8ea8ea8fcedd6f8f153c886025a9c082c367d143",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
